window.products.push({"id":606047,"name":"HOME-X Colorful Aluminum Drinking Cups Set of 6, Colored Metal Tumblers, Shatter Resistant, Stackable, 6 Metallic Colors - 16 Ounces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hGAcv4bfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALUMINUM CUPS: Looking for fun drinkware for your kitchen? Try this set of aluminum tumblers. Get 6 metal cups of different colors to add a splash of fun to your kitchen supplies. Aluminum remains cool to the touch, helping the tumbler keep your beverage cold and refreshing. Enjoy juice, water, milk, soda, and more from this pack of tumblers. RAINBOW COLORS: In this set of 6, you will receive cups in various colors, including pink, blue, turquoise, yellow, green, and purple. Kids and adults alike will love the bright and bold colors along with the metallic finish of these tumblers. NON-BREAKABLE: These metal cups are extremely durable, making them ideal for families with young children. Unlike glass, they won't shatter if they are dropped on the ground. These cups are stackable, reducing space in your kitchen cupboards. RETRO LOOK: Aluminum tumblers are a vintage and retro addition to any kitchen. With sleek and durable sides, these tumblers hold 16 ounces each. Drink wine, whiskey, water, or other drinks from these small cups while enjoying the metallic finish. Order these cups in bulk to have an entire matching set. HAND-WASH ONLY: To maintain the integrity of these aluminum glasses, we recommend washing by hand with water and gentle dish soap. Do not put these glasses in the dishwasher. Likewise, these cups are not microwave safe. However, with proper care, these cups can last for years to come—even with everyday use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hGAcv4bfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08J3NWMTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J3NWMTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J3NWMTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
