window.products.push({"id":606103,"name":"watchget Coffee Sifter Ground Coffee Receiver Stainless Steel Non-slip base, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519JCrZbPsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"☕ 【WHY COFFEE NEED TO BE SIEVED】Sieve the fine powder(less than 500um) or super fine powder(less than 250um) to improve the particle size distribution. ☕ 【PROFESSIONAL COFFEE GRIND SIEVE】The coffee powder sifter effectively shifts the fine powder for a more uniform coffee powder, avoid over-extraction of fine or under-extraction of coarse. Uneven grinding does not mean more fine powder, and uneven grinding will lead to uneven extraction. ☕ 【SIEVE HOLE SIZE】The sieve hole size is 500um/0.5mm. This sifter can effectively sieve the fines and super fines to make the coffee powder evenly more sieved. The overall dissolution rate of coffee is balanced. Meets your daily coffee powder coarse and fine needs, easily have a clear coffee taste. ☕ 【PREMIUM MATERIAL】Made of food grade stainless steel which is durable and sturdy. The frosted coating allows the sifter a better appearance and makes it harder to stick fingerprints. Equipped with a non-slip base, no need to worry about the sifter removing during use. Detachable design,it's easy to clean. ☕ 【MULTIPLE USE】It is an integrated sieve with powder sieving, powder receiving and coffee smelling. It can remove the bitterness and miscellaneous taste of coffee. It can also be used as a receiver under the coffee grinder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519JCrZbPsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"watchget","source_asin":"B09F9T7XF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F9T7XF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F9T7XF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
