window.products.push({"id":606151,"name":"Impress IM-719BX Box Fan (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LRkELig9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LRkELig9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07WKD2JKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WKD2JKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WKD2JKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606152,"name":"Gordon Ramsay by Royal Doulton Stainless-Steel 10-Inch Nonstick Fry Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31w7LkLNeJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The gordon ramsay by royal doulton collection offers a fresh approach to modern table setting by keeping it utterly simple, comfortable and functional. Plates feature a flat cross section to prevent cutlery from sliding and the sauceboat has an exaggerated handle for easy use and a wide spout for easy, non-drip pouring. Gordon's selection of primarily white tones showcases the food itself, which gordon feels is most appealing to the appetites of diners. Because the entire collection will be used on the dining tables and in the kitchens of ramsay's london restaurants as well as in his new york city outpost, the london nyc, ramsay is demanding a new standard of perfection. The gordon ramsay by royal doulton collection is influenced by gordon's years of cooking and presenting meals to thousands of new and faithful patrons and he is looking to impress thousands more. Clearly, gordon has made a terrific impression, his restaurants have been awarded michelin stars for excellence as well as being knighted by england's queen elizabeth. Royal doulton is thrilled to bring gordon ramsay's products to life, bringing affordable luxury to consumers everywhere. Amazon.com Fry up a western scramble of eggs, ham, onions, peppers, and jack cheese in this 10-inch nonstick fry pan. Gordon Ramsay, the captious but celebrated chef and television personality, designed the pan as part of his new cookware line for Royal Doulton. Like the Scottish-born chef, the pan excels under heat and resists dents over years of hard use. The fry pan features a durable three-layer construction. The brushed 18/10 stainless-steel exterior combats corrosion, while the heavy-gauge aluminum core enables accelerated heat conduction and distribution for searing or frying tasks. To prevent food from sticking, the pan provides a nonstick, DuPont Teflon cooking surface. The chef transports the pan to and fro with a hollow, stainless-steel handle, which is double riveted for extra security. A hanging hole is installed at the handle's end. Dishwasher-safe, the pan also accommodates oven use, safely sustaining temperatures up to 500 degrees F. The fry pan stacks together with other pieces from Ramsay's cookware line for neat storage, and it comes in a protective polishing bag. A manufacturer's limited lifetime warranty covers this item. The pan measures 18 by 10 by 1-3/4 inches and weighs 4 pounds upon shipping. --Jessica Reuling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31w7LkLNeJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Doulton","source_asin":"B000PJMPA4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000PJMPA4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000PJMPA4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
