window.products.push({"id":606237,"name":"PARTY JOY 12PCS 15.4In Artificial Hydrangea Silk Flowers Bouquet Faux Hydrangea Stems for Wedding Centerpieces Home Decor (White,12pcs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wVV5n1ANS._AC_SL1146_.jpg","description":"【Large Size】Total length 15.35'', stem 10'', each has 126pcs small petal and 2pcs green leaves with green stem; Such a long size is perfect for decoration in a tall vase; 【Suitable for Matching】You can mix and match other artificial flowers,rose and calla to make a special centerpieces flowers arrangment! 【Easy to Decorate】They pack five pieces nicely, and the smaller stems are tied together with rubber bands and you can cut them off. After cutting off the rubber bands, you can bend the small stems of the flowers and prepare to spread them out, and then blow them up with a hair dryer. They look beautiful. The main stem of the whole flower is elastic. If you want to make it shorter, you can cut it off or bend it; 【Very Affordable】You have to know that it is not an ordinary quality product. If you buy it in a mall, you need to pay 50 dollars or more to buy it; 【Note】As they do get a bit crumpled during storage and shipping,so your recieved it, need to \"fluff up\" your hydrangeas!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wVV5n1ANS._AC_SL1146_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PARTY JOY","source_asin":"B09Y94Y91S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y94Y91S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y94Y91S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606238,"name":"Hickory 15 x 10 x 1 inch Cutting Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YMHd3gabL._SL1242_.jpg","description":"This is a handmade large edge grain cutting board made from South Carolina Hickory with built in handles. This board can also be used as a serving tray, cheese board or Charcuterie board and will look amazing on any table or countertop. It is finished with our own custom wood balm which is included with purchase. The dimensions of this cutting board are 15 by 10 by 1 inch. All designs seen in this board will vary as it is a made to order item, but it will include the variations in color unless otherwise specified. All colors and patterns seen are from the Sapwood of the Hickory. If you like this board and would like a different size or shape made please do not hesitate to contact me for custom orders. Like all wood cutting boards this board should be cared for properly to allow this product to last a lifetime and look great doing it! Here are some care tips: Hand-wash with hot, soapy water. Dry thoroughly, never run through dishwasher or submerge in water -Occasionally rub with a food-safe mineral oil or custom wood balm to keep wood from drying out (included with purchase) -Store on edge or on rubber feet in a dry area away from extreme temperatures","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YMHd3gabL._SL1242_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09693YX21","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09693YX21","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09693YX21","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606239,"name":"Chicago 3 Artwork by Richard Wallich, 16 by 20-Inch, Black Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817lkMmC5nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a river surrounded by tall city buildings. American impressionist Richard Wallich has spent more than 30 years honing his painting talents. He studied painting and figure drawing at the American Academy of Art in Chicago, Illinois, where he first worked in realism, but found the style too time-consuming. He soon discovered that impressionism allowed him to work much faster and more spontaneously, so that he could really immerse himself in the painting. Among other high honors, Richard was commissioned by the NFL in 1989 to paint for the Super Bowl and in 1996 he was the official artist for the Summer Olympics in Atlanta, Georgia. He has since been commissioned by several large companies such as Coca Cola, M & M Mars and American Airlines. An 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a black frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional frames and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817lkMmC5nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00I8J6WES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I8J6WES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I8J6WES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
