window.products.push({"id":606255,"name":"2- Tier Rectangle Wood Tray | Rustic Coffee Table Serving Tray Platters - Kitchen Islands Free Standing Catering Trays with Hook - Dining Table Center","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lqedl8nVL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝗘𝗡𝗗𝗟𝗘𝗦𝗦 𝗗𝗘𝗖𝗢𝗥 𝗖𝗔𝗣𝗔𝗖𝗜𝗧𝗜𝗘𝗦 - Not only is it a serving utensil, our wooden tiered stand is a unique decorative piece for display. It makes a great addition to your country - styled coffee table, coffee bar, kitchen counter, living room or dining room. You could use the tray to display cake, dry food, fruits or even seasonal ornaments as centerpieces for dining room table. 𝐑𝐔𝐒𝐓𝐈𝐂 𝐀𝐂𝐂𝐄𝐍𝐓 - A distressed wood finish gives the wooden cake stand a vintage black/white color. Meanwhile, its elegant design, in combination with black metal hook on the top adds a feel of rustic and warmth to the whole standing platter. It adds a charming French farmhouse vibe to your home decor. 𝐄𝐀𝐒𝐘 𝐓𝐎 𝐀𝐒𝐒𝐄𝐌𝐁𝐋𝐄 - With just a few simple steps, you can put the cake stand into a complete piece. When not in use, it can be disassembled quickly for convenient storage. 𝐏𝐑𝐎𝐓𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐍𝐆 𝐌𝐎𝐓𝐇𝐄𝐑 𝐄𝐀𝐑𝐓𝐇 - Our wooden tiered cake stand set is handmade from high quality Acacia wood, a plant that is largely grown in Vietnam. The harvesting and processing of this plant leave little or no harmful impacts on the environment. We limited the use of chemicals during production. 𝗬𝗢𝗨𝗥 𝗣𝗨𝗥𝗖𝗛𝗔𝗦𝗘 𝗠𝗔𝗞𝗘𝗦 𝗔𝗡 𝗜𝗠𝗣𝗔𝗖𝗧- MadeTerra is a local maker-to-market company by artisans in Vietnam. This wood tiered serving stand, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Vietnamese local Villages. With every purchase you make, you are helping us make a difference, contributing to global fair trade, supporting artisan communities and preserving the indigenous crafts and cultures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lqedl8nVL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B08Q7L1X41","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q7L1X41","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q7L1X41","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
