window.products.push({"id":606397,"name":"Ancient Cookware® Thai Clay Hot Pot, Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ykr3LbW1L._AC_.jpg","description":"A fantastic way to relax over dinner with a few friends using our Unglazed Thai Clay Pot. Use the Clay Pot over charcoal or solid fuel and fill it with an aromatic broth and once boiling, add vegetables and meat and eat as done. It is also perfect for an authentic presentation of curries and soups. The untreated natural clay enhances the natural flavors of the dish and seals in moisture, while retaining heat. Set comes with the pot, lid and burner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ykr3LbW1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancient Cookware","source_asin":"B01LQN08YM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LQN08YM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LQN08YM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606398,"name":"Kahler Omaggio - Ceramic Candlestick Holder - Small (Black/White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y+8QdJqLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The unmistakable and historic black stripes of the Omaggio series from Kahler Design grace this slim and elegant candlestick. The Omaggio series is a modern design classic. The iconic hand-painted stripes are represented in countless Nordic homes and loved by design enthusiasts all over the world. This 6.3 in. high candlestick is the smallest of three available sizes. Pair this with one of the same size on a table, or create a tableau with all three sizes to light up a windowsill or sideboard. Hand-crafted from faience ceramic by artisans in Portugal and then hand-painted, each Omaggio candle holder is a unique piece of art. Other products are available in the Omaggio series including vases, serving bowls and dishes (see our other listings). The modern Omaggio series was inspired by Tulle Emborg, one of the talented women painters in Kahler's Danish workshop in the 1930s and 1940s. The design has been reinterpreted and revived by the talented designer duo Stilleben (Ditte Reckweg and Jelena Schou Nordentoft). \"We have always been totally fascinated by Kahler's epoch-making ceramics, which have played an enormous part in putting Denmark on the map when it comes to art and design. It is a great pleasure to help bring the art ceramics heritage into a new era and a new form language\", say the two designers. It is Kahler's mission to create accessible art for the people. Now a leading Scandinavian design brand, their roots go back to 1839 as a small Danish pottery producer. For more than 175 years, their tradition has been to collaborate with significant artists to provide distinctive and contemporary collections. Kahler is firmly established as part of Danish cultural heritage, and they strive to preserve history and traditions in each handmade design. Height: 6.3 In. Diameter: 2.2 In.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y+8QdJqLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kahler","source_asin":"B0761W962T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0761W962T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0761W962T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
