window.products.push({"id":606446,"name":"Killer Snowman Horror Ornament - Scary Prop and Decoration for Halloween, Christmas, Parties and Events - Jaed Demers Series - By HorrorNaments","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UntvPEdkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"You’re in for a spooky treat with HorrorNaments Snowman Collectible Ornament! This creepy ornament is a spooky and fun way to celebrate the Halloween, Christmas or holiday season. Any Halloween lover or fan of horror will get a kick out of this sinister snowman who is up to no good. About This Product: - Snowman Ornament- Collectible Item- Makes A Great Gift For Horror Enthusiasts- Metal Loop Accommodates Ornament Hooks & String For Hanging - Great For Halloween Decor, Haunted Attractions & Gift Shops THIS CREEPY SNOWMAN WANTS MORE BUTTONS. Christmastime normally conjures up feelings of warmth, spending time gathered around the fire- but someone’s been left out in the cold, and he isn’t happy. This sinister snowman comes complete with an icy stare and bone-chilling visage, so don’t be surprised if the temperature suddenly drops when you put him on your tree. This ornament features a sturdy design that will last for seasons to come and features a metal loop on top to attach ornament hooks or string to so you can display it around your home for the holidays or in your haunted attraction. They are also great items for gift shops, particularly for Halloween and horror festivals and events. HORRORNAMENTS ARE THE PERFECT COLLECTIBLE FOR HALLOWEEN ENTHUSIASTS. HorrorNaments was created by a Halloween enthusiast and haunted attraction owner. They’re perfect for Halloween decor. The chilling detail and artistry will impress true fans of anything related to Halloween and horror. At HorrorNaments we are committed to celebrating the spirit and thrill of the scariest season by creating quality products we’re sure you will enjoy. If for any reason you aren’t completely satisfied with your purchase, contact us so that we can be of assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UntvPEdkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HorrorNaments","source_asin":"B06XCR1HT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XCR1HT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XCR1HT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
