window.products.push({"id":606551,"name":"Easy Release Ice Cube Tray 14 Cube Trays,Ice-Cube-Molds(Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61STBERd3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of struggling with your old ice cube trays which make ice cubes slither across your counter or floor, freeze excess water and keep the ice cubes altogether, and separate cubes easily.  A Must-Have Kitchen Gadget The ice cube tray features 14-cube and a smart removable lid, which help you make nice-sized cubes easily. Just fill the trays with water/fruits/ ice cream/soda/wine, cover the lid and then put them into the freezer. Since it is dishwasher safe, you could just put them into your dishwasher after use.  Professional Quality and Easy to Use Made of PP and TPE material which are certified by LFGB to guarantee safety and durability. With the TPE material made bottom, it is easy to remove the ice cubes. The smart removable lid helps prevent the freezing of excess water and keeps ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors.  Space-Saving Feature These easy-release trays could stack easily and securely in the freezer without sticking, saving some space for other items.  Note: 1. Do not use metal brush to clean these ice cube trays. 2. Do not clean the ice cube trays with strong detergent in case they get corroded. 3. Keep these ice cube trays away from fire sources in case they get distorted. 4. Please wipe out the trays with soft cloth. 5. You'd better not add too much water in case the ice and the cover sticking together. 6. After freezing, please give icy tray a twist to loosen the cubes, then place the tray in a large freezer bag and pop each cube out.  Specifications: Material: PP & TPE Dimensions: 12.8” x 5.3” x 1.6” (L x W x H) Color: White + Green","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61STBERd3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOOZZONG","source_asin":"B073WB29X7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073WB29X7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073WB29X7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
