window.products.push({"id":606563,"name":"[125 Pack] 6 x 5 Inch Nacho Trays - Small Clear Plastic Anti Spill French Fry Holder, 2 Compartment Disposable Dinner Tray for Hot Food Container, Che","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kaTBoWUXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Excellent Presentation and Design These nacho trays 2 compartments with 6 inches length, 5 inches width, and 1.5 inches height are awesome for making food look more delectable no matter whether you own a deli or a food truck. The capacity of 12.1 oz gives more food portions to the customers, and you get 125 of these in a case which means you can serve food in them to the customers for weeks. No Spillage Worries Every nacho tray offered here can be used to enjoy a variety of foods without bothering about spillage or breakage issues. These trays are sturdier than they look and have ribbed siding that ensures that your food won't slide off even if you are on the move. You can also offer warm food in it without worrying about burning a hole in the trays. Multipurpose Nacho trays 2 compartments can be used for serving different types of dishes. These trays can hold sandwiches to nachos, combo platters to cookies, and you can serve anything. It will make the sides more appetizing than ever. Easy clean-up Disposable nacho tray is meant for one-time use only. It means that you or your staff don't have to spend a lot of time in clean up. Just put a dustbin near your food truck or deli and request the customers to throw the trays when they are done. When they do that, you won't need to bother about cleaning up when the day ends. Suit Everyone The perfect size and two compartments of these trays ensure that everyone from a small kid to an older adult can enjoy a bit of a snack without worrying about balancing the tray or holding it steady. Even if your hands shake a little, the food will not slide into the other compartment nor will it mess up your clothes as these trays are sturdier than you think.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kaTBoWUXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fit Meal Prep","source_asin":"B07LC2TCM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LC2TCM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LC2TCM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606564,"name":"Geek Details LOTR Themed Coffee Mug, 11 Oz, White (White One Mug To Rule Them All)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O30SnHAbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tumbler color - BLACK Our Black color Tumbler Mug has a modern design with a surface that has a pleasant tactile sensation to it, making it comfortable and convenient to hold. This mug was simply designed to be a life-long travel buddy. Our goal is to produce quality tumblers with a simple and smart design. We strive to satisfy your needs with the range of our quality products, which include insulated tumblers, bottles, cups and thermoses. You’ll be sure to ENJOY A CLEAN AND FRESH TASTE of your favorite drink from OUR stainless steel tumblers. No matter what climate you’re traveling in, our Tumblers are sure to contain the heat of your hot drink on your alpine hiking trips in the mountains or the keep your cold drink cool on your Sahara desert expeditions. Our Tumbler Mug was designed for: -Casual road trips -Hiking or backpacking trips -Hot days on the beach -Alpine hiking on snowy mountains -Also great for just drinking water -Your favorite smoothies -Mothers feeding their kids Our Tumbler Mugs were designed with the following features: - Designed with split proof lid that can be opened with one finger (The split proof lid is sealed with silicone keeping it air tight) - Lid is made with a durable plastic Our Tumbler Mugs have great additional features for keeping your life simple: -Designed with a hole on the magnetic lid, making sipping or fitting straws in convenient -Designed to fit any cup holder in your car Technological Features of our Tumbler Mugs include: - Designed to keep hot beverages hot for up to 6 hours - Designed to keep cold drinks cool for up 24 hours - Made with SEAMLESS Inner and outer DESIGN - Made from a DURABLE STAINLESS STEEL 18/8 - Produces no condensation - Made BPA free and from a non-toxic material, which is eco-friendly - Designed with a durable scratch proof Powder coating - Dishwash safe Dimensions: Diameter of lid: 3 1/2 inches Height: 6 7/8 inches Diameter of bottom: 6 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O30SnHAbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geek Details","source_asin":"B0153PO020","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0153PO020","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0153PO020","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
