window.products.push({"id":606784,"name":"Show Stoppers - Light Up Bottle Stoppers (Style = CAP)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Can you imagine turning the bottles in your home bar into a light show, instantly? Can you imagine playing music at your next party and having all your wine, beer, liquor, water or soda bottles come to life with an interactive light show which will respond to the music in the room? Can you imagine switching to a more tranquil mode and having all the bottles lit with a steady glow that your friends will never forget? We did! Presenting Show Stoppers! Replace any beverage bottle cap or cork with a Show Stopper and watch in amazement as your beverage bottle begins to respond to your music with a sound-responsive light show. If you like, you may want to use the STEADY ON feature to change the mood of the room to a more tranquil or romantic setting, the choice is yours. Each Show Stopper has both modes built-in to them and you get a set of 4 colors - Red, Green, White & Blue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Can You Imagine","source_asin":"B004XDAYO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004XDAYO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004XDAYO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
