window.products.push({"id":606786,"name":"Plow & Hearth Small Americana Patriotic Bunting with Embroidered Stars, 100% Cotton Duck Fabric, Red – Ecru – Blue, 30 in W x 17 1/4 in H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QCIRKrG3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Plow & Hearth Exclusive - Our traditional, Half-Round Cotton Duck Patriotic Vintage Bunting has embroidered stars on 100% cotton duck fabric with three top grommets for easy hanging, making it an ideal way to add patriotic spirit to almost any location. Red, blue and ecru colors give our bunting its nostalgic appearance. Imported. Sold individually. Size: 30\"W x 17\"H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QCIRKrG3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plow & Hearth","source_asin":"B005F016LC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005F016LC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005F016LC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606787,"name":"Tovolo Flex-Core Long-Handled Silicone Jar Scraper Spatula, Wood Handle, Heat-Resistant Silicone Head With Curved Front for Scooping & Scraping, Dishw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kWbcGbkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Clean out your jars completely with Tovolo’s Long-Handled Silicone Jar Scraper Spatula With Wood Handle. Long, narrow head fits into small jars, and the angled head ensures you can reach into corners to scoop out every last bit of your peanut butter, jelly, jam, preserves, nut butter, mayonnaise, condiments, and more. Head is curved slightly to help scoop out your food; flattened back spreads your nut butters and condiments evenly. The head also features a curved shoulder where it meets the long handle, which is designed to swipe smoothly along the lip of a jar, getting every last bit. Completely smooth silicone surface allows for even spreading, and edges are tapered to a sharp point to scrape sides clean. Wooden handle adds an air of traditionalism to the modern silicone spatula. The ergonomic handle is designed to fit comfortably in hand as you mix, fold, scrape, spread, flip, and serve. The wood is tough, durable, and thick enough to tackle your toughest kitchen jobs. Silicone head is reinforced with a sturdy nylon core for rigidity and strength. This combination offers a solid core that can tackle thick batters and hearty doughs while the flexible edges provide just enough give to scrape the edges of the bowl clean. BPA-free silicone is scratch-resistant, stain-resistant, and food-safe for the best possible kitchen tool. The soft-touch silicone will not scratch pans, making it a gentle and safe choice for nonstick and cast iron cookware in addition to your jars, blenders, and other small spaces. Silicone is heat resistant up to 600 degrees Fahrenheit. Made of BPA-free silicone and wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kWbcGbkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B0B5HRNRR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5HRNRR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5HRNRR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606788,"name":"4-Pack Shower Caddy Shelf Organizer - No Drilling Adhesive Wall Mounted Shower Shelf for Inside Shower, Rustproof Stainless Steel Shower Storage with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Vbsmv8TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Specification: 1. 2 Extra soap dish holders: The shower rack with 2 soap dishes can organize your bathroom essentials well, it can also place soap, sponge, brush. 2. Fixed hooks: 16 fixed hooks (4 hooks more than similar products on the market) are enough to hang towels and other bathroom supplies, also make it easier to take things without worrying about moving. 3. Large capacity: Large Shelf: 12.6 x 5.3 x 2.3 inches; Regular Shelf: 12x 4.6 x 2.3 inches, enough to store shampoo, shower gel, toothpaste and other bathroom essentials. 4. Multi-purpose: Shower caddy basket shelf can also be used to place spice in the kitchen, textbooks in the study, small potted plants in the living room, or anywhere you need additional organization. 5. Durable: Made of 100% stainless steel, rust-proof and durable. The outer spray paint process provides a second protection, which looks as good as new even after months or years of usage. 6. Space saving & Match your apartment perfectly: The large storage capacity provides enough space to put bathroom essentials, simple and elegant design is suitable for a variety of decoration styles without affecting the appearance. Material: SUS 304 Stainless Steel Color: Black Large Shelf:：12.6 x 5.3 x 2.3 inches, 32 x 13.5 x 6 cm Regular Shelf:：12x 4.6 x 2.3 inches, 30 x 12 x 6 cm 2 Methods of Installation：Adhesive Hooks and Drilling How to use? 1. Clean and dry the surface. 2. Tear off the protective film of the adhesive. 3.Paste on the wall and squeeze out air. 4.Hang the shelf, plates and wait for 12-24 hours to use. How to remove adhesive Use hair dryer to heat the adhesive surface. After heating,the film will be taken off easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Vbsmv8TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arinster","source_asin":"B09PDMBZ6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PDMBZ6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PDMBZ6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
