window.products.push({"id":606895,"name":"Perber Cotton Rope Woven Basket With Handles for Shelves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZZ9TtSt7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"13.5\" x 11\" x 9.5\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZZ9TtSt7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perber","source_asin":"B077T6H44H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077T6H44H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077T6H44H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606896,"name":"Chefn Switchit Dual-Ended Small Spatula, Yolk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21KUCGxF9JL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description One one end, the Chef'n Switchit is outstanding for broad, sweeping strokes. On the other end, it allows for more control and finesse. Using either end, the ingenious asymmetric design easily reaches any angle in any pot, pan or bowl. Here, straightforward functionality conbines expertly with inspired design and perfect porportions. Amazon.com Use a Switchit spatula once, and you'll be hooked. Unlike rubber spatulas whose heads can come off the handle unexpectedly, the Switchit is one solid whole that feels reliable in the hand while you stir food in nonstick cookware or scrape out that last bit of mayo from a jar. Made of food-grade, stain-free silicone, the ends are firm yet flexible, while a steel core provides strength and rigidity under your grip. Chef'n designs the Switchit with asymmetrically shaped ends that reach into practically any jar and follow the contours of any bowl, pot, or skillet. Withstanding heat up to 650 degrees F, the Switchit spatula can be used to scramble eggs and stir soup, and can even be left in the pan during cooking. Available in bright, modern colors, the small dual-ended spatula measures 10 inches in length and is dishwasher-safe. Chef'n approaches housewares with a creative mind and sense of humor. Innovations are its signature element, an approach started by founder and self-proclaimed Famous Inventor, David Holcomb, with his Garlic Machine in 1982. From rabbit-eared pepper grinders to collapsible colanders, Chef'n delights as it brings fresh seasoning to the kitchen and home. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21KUCGxF9JL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef'n","source_asin":"B00138UK2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00138UK2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00138UK2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606897,"name":"Ivation Renewable/Rechargeable Wireless Mini Dehumidifier - Suited for Closets, Boats, RVs, Lockers & Gun Safes - Uses Non-Toxic Silica Gel Crystals W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811zDV315WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Remember Those Disposable Dehumidifier Pellets? Ivation’s renewable mini dehumidifier works in similar fashion, just many times better and with no used up pellets to discard. Our little 8\" x 2 ½\" x 5 ½\" device is packed full of silica gel crystals. They are non-toxic and odorless pebbles that safely and effectively absorb moisture from the air in their vicinity. Silica gel crystals have better dehumidifying abilities – with far greater absorption rates – than that of traditional soluble humidity-absorbing products. They are also reusable, which means lower long-term costs as well as less waste. How Does It Work? As ambient temperatures reach higher levels of relative humidity (RH), the silica gel crystals start absorbing moisture from the air. The more moisture they absorb, the less blue they become. The crystals gradually change to a light pink color, as can be seen in the device’s little window. Fully pink crystals mean they are full of water and need to be “recharged.” Depending on the area’s moisture level, a fully charged dehumidifier unit should last an average of 30-60 days before the crystals turn fully pink. How to Recharge/Renew? What happens when you plug in the set cord is as follows: A gentle power draw from the wall outlet delivers a bit of heat to the compartment of the gel crystals. Because the heat is from an electrical source, it contains no humidity or moisture whatsoever. The crystals therefore slowly heat up, releasing their accumulated moisture into the air. It is very important that you place the dehumidifier in a well-ventilated area, preferably next to a window, as you don’t wish for the moisture to reenter the air from which it pulled it in the first place. After about 12 hours, the gel crystals turn blue again and the dehumidifier is as good as new.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811zDV315WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivation","source_asin":"B00KO3E9A0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KO3E9A0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KO3E9A0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
