window.products.push({"id":606946,"name":"Chill Sack Bean Bag Chair: Giant 5' Memory Foam Furniture Bean Bag - Big Sofa with Soft Micro Fiber Cover - Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K1Qlgv9HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our 5 foot chill bag is ideal for your child, teenager or college student that loves to play video games and watch their favorite movies and TV programs. The perfect addition to a basement, family room or dorm, it’s large enough to fit two small adults but is ideal for one adult or child. We call them bean bag chairs, but there are no beans or Styrofoam pellets here. Just the softest, highest quality shredded foam like those used in high end couches. Dimensions: 60” x 60” x 34” weight: 55 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K1Qlgv9HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chill Sack","source_asin":"B09N22SRF4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N22SRF4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N22SRF4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606947,"name":"Whole House Worlds The Hamptons Herringbone Basket, Bamboo Leaves, Citrus Green and Almond and White Clay Finish, Basketry Art Bowls, 10 Inch Diameter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yl1XChZFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Eco-friendly and eye-catching, our Hamptons Herringbone Basket Bowl pairs traditional shapes and patterns with natural colors. These finely woven pieces are accented allover with traces of white clay between the pale citrus green rims and bodies of toasted almond. Made by Hand With Exquisite Materials Each basket has been meticulously crafted using sustainably harvested bamboo leaves. Carefully curated leaves are cut and dried in the sun before being mixed with white clay and dried again before being dyed. Only after another day of drying can our skilled artisans start work on weave each unique piece. The underlying metal framework these sturdy double walled baskets are made to last. Well sized, this basket measures as follows: 10 ¼ D x 4 3/8 H inches. Splendid for spring and summer gifting, these stylish basket bowls are perfect to hold fruit and bread or to act as catchalls for all sorts of household items. Rustic and refined, this basket is perfectly situated in both coastal and country homes or city chic pads alike. The fresh lush tones and chunky tactile weave are perfect to pair with other like colors in your home. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yl1XChZFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B06X6D3MDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06X6D3MDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06X6D3MDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606948,"name":"Intelligent Design, Gemstone Tiles Wall Art 2 Pieces Gel Coated Canvas, Ready to Hang Silver Frame, Modern Design, Abstract Watercolor Painting Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7178EB9EbgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Intelligent Design Gemstone Tiles Decorative Box Set by artist Norm Wyatt Jr. adds a subtle and unique update to your home. Each framed paper wall art features a colorful abstract stone print in blue, green, and neutral tones that create a fun and fresh update; while a silver frame adds the finishing touch. Comes as a set, each piece measures 16.25x16.25\" and features a saw tooth fixture on the reverse making easy to hang and arrange on any wall. Simply display these pieces together or separately to add a charismatic touch to any space. Spot clean only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7178EB9EbgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Intelligent Design","source_asin":"B01I4ZUHGE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I4ZUHGE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I4ZUHGE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
