window.products.push({"id":606968,"name":"Kenney Hailey 1\" Premium Decorative Window Curtain Rod, Pewter Gray, 66-120\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616zmXI6i8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of style to your home with the Hailey 1\" Premium Decorative Window Curtain Rod by Kenney. The 1 inch diameter Hailey curtain rod in pewter features matching geometric ball shaped finial ends. Use on larger windows in larger rooms, such as your dining room, bedroom or living room, to hang heavyweight curtains as well as thermal or room darkening curtains. The telescoping rod adjusts from 66 inches to 120 inches to fit your window and projects 3.8-5.3 inches from the wall. It is ideal for hanging curtains with pockets, grommets, back tabs, and tab tops, but can also be used with clip rings. Drapery Hardware Set Includes: one telescoping steel curtain rod with decorative geometric ball finials (3.86\" L x 2.84\" W x 2.84\" H), two adjustable mounting brackets, one center support, screws, drywall anchors, and installation instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616zmXI6i8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenney","source_asin":"B0BKZKFMD3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZKFMD3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZKFMD3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
