window.products.push({"id":606987,"name":"Ergonomic Kneeling Chair with Backrest Adjustable Height with Thick and Comfortable Cushion and Smooth Gliding Casters Correct Sitting Posture Suitabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81taONHTvjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GOOD POSTURE COMES EFFORTLESSLY - This ergonomic kneeling chair with a backrest keeps your back upright at a comfortable angle and distributes the pressure between the buttock and legs, which effectively relieves the discomfort of the neck, back, and spine and allows you to enjoy your workday EASY TO ASSEMBLE AND ADJUST - The posture chair is easy to install with clear instructions; Use the hydraulic lift to adjust the seat height and kneeling pad to get it just right; Height adjustable from 21.6” to 25.6”; Note that you'd better get up periodically throughout the day and stretch when using this chair for long periods COMFORTABLE CUSHIONS - The cushion thickness of the VIVOHOME kneeling chair is up to 4” and features resilience memory foam; The upgraded thick cushion can effectively protect the hips and knees from injury, providing maximum comfort, and will not deform after long-time use SAFETY CONSTRUCTION - Constructed with a heavy-duty steel frame, its surface is sprayed with anti-oxidation treatment to prevent rust and wear; This kneeling chair comes with sturdy and polished metal fittings for each connection, which has strong corrosion resistance, to increase the firmness of the product and extend the service life (up to 242 lbs powerful loading capacity) 360° ROTATING WHEELS - 4 removable metal casters can rotate 360 degrees, which makes the work station chair move smoothly, even on carpeting; 2 of them have locks on the wheels for stability; Great for people who are used to working long hours at home","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81taONHTvjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIVOHOME","source_asin":"B08QCCVM8D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QCCVM8D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QCCVM8D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":606988,"name":"American Metalcraft MCL12 Stainless Steel Measuring Cup, 1/2-Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nzRVHwctL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The American metalcraft MCL12 stainless steel measuring cup works well in both commercial settings and casual home kitchens. Constructed from sturdy, stainless steel, its design prevents undue rust and corrosion over the years. Its extra-long handle is also stainless steel and is shaped in a swooping, wire design for easy gripping as well as for ideal hanging in your cabinet, pantry, or elsewhere. A slight lip on one edge of the cup also helps to better guide its filled contents and prevent spillage, all without taking away from its overall smooth design. For better, more precise measurements in creating pastries, pastas or other tasty recipes, this measuring cup does the job! this provides a ½-cup measuring and pouring capacity. With 70 years of service, American metalcraft is a leader in the food service industry for trend-focused and unique products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nzRVHwctL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American METALCRAFT, Inc.","source_asin":"B07BMCXCTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-606988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BMCXCTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BMCXCTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
